# Multi-Provider LLM Fallback Pipeline (Generalized Key Management)

This plan outlines the architecture and changes required to implement a **sequential multi-provider LLM fallback pipeline** with generalized, multi-key rotation capabilities for all cloud LLM providers.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Consolidated Config & Backward Compatibility:**
> We are extending the `ProviderSettings` configuration class to support:
> * `ApiKey` (single string, for backward compatibility)
> * `ApiKeys` (list of strings, for configuring multiple keys)
> * `RateLimitResetMinutes` (defaulting to 60, reset cooldown duration for exhausted keys)
>
> We will update `llm.json` to show how multiple keys can be defined for any provider.

---

## Proposed Changes

### Domain Component

No changes are required in the core Domain project. The fallback router will implement the existing [ILlmService](file:///c:/Neosoft/Interview%20Quality%20Dashboard/InterviewAudit%20AI/InterviewAudit.Domain/Interfaces/ILlmService.cs) contract.

---

### Infrastructure Component

We will implement a unified `LlmApiKeyManager`, update individual cloud providers (`OpenAiLlmService`, `ClaudeLlmService`, `GeminiLlmService`, `GroqLlmService`) to support key rotation on rate limits, and register them in DI.

#### [NEW] [ILlmApiKeyManager.cs](file:///c:/Neosoft/Interview%20Quality%20Dashboard/InterviewAudit%20AI/InterviewAudit.Infrastructure/Llm/ILlmApiKeyManager.cs)
* Create a generalized key manager interface.
  ```csharp
  namespace InterviewAudit.Infrastructure.Llm
  {
      public interface ILlmApiKeyManager
      {
          string GetNextAvailableKey(string providerName);
          void MarkKeyExhausted(string providerName, string key);
          bool HasAvailableKeys(string providerName);
      }
  }
  ```

#### [NEW] [LlmApiKeyManager.cs](file:///c:/Neosoft/Interview%20Quality%20Dashboard/InterviewAudit%20AI/InterviewAudit.Infrastructure/Llm/LlmApiKeyManager.cs)
* Implement `ILlmApiKeyManager` with a thread-safe `ConcurrentDictionary<string, DateTimeOffset>` mapping exhausted keys to their expiration reset time.
* Resolve keys for a provider by checking:
  1. `ProviderSettings.ApiKeys`
  2. `ProviderSettings.ApiKey`
  3. `LlmSettings.ApiKey` (root fallback)
  4. (For Groq) `LlmSettings.GroqApiKeys`
* Filter out blank entries and placeholders (e.g. starting with `"YOUR_"`).

#### [DELETE] [IGroqApiKeyManager.cs](file:///c:/Neosoft/Interview%20Quality%20Dashboard/InterviewAudit%20AI/InterviewAudit.Infrastructure/Llm/IGroqApiKeyManager.cs)
* Remove the Groq-specific interface.

#### [DELETE] [GroqApiKeyManager.cs](file:///c:/Neosoft/Interview%20Quality%20Dashboard/InterviewAudit%20AI/InterviewAudit.Infrastructure/Llm/GroqApiKeyManager.cs)
* Remove the Groq-specific implementation class.

#### [MODIFY] [LlmServiceFactory.cs](file:///c:/Neosoft/Interview%20Quality%20Dashboard/InterviewAudit%20AI/InterviewAudit.Infrastructure/Llm/LlmServiceFactory.cs)
* Extend `ProviderSettings` to include `ApiKeys` and `RateLimitResetMinutes`.
* Modify `GroqSettings` to inherit from `ProviderSettings`.

#### [MODIFY] [OpenAiLlmService.cs](file:///c:/Neosoft/Interview%20Quality%20Dashboard/InterviewAudit%20AI/InterviewAudit.Infrastructure/Llm/OpenAiLlmService.cs), [ClaudeLlmService.cs](file:///c:/Neosoft/Interview%20Quality%20Dashboard/InterviewAudit%20AI/InterviewAudit.Infrastructure/Llm/ClaudeLlmService.cs), [GeminiLlmService.cs](file:///c:/Neosoft/Interview%20Quality%20Dashboard/InterviewAudit%20AI/InterviewAudit.Infrastructure/Llm/GeminiLlmService.cs), [GroqLlmService.cs](file:///c:/Neosoft/Interview%20Quality%20Dashboard/InterviewAudit%20AI/InterviewAudit.Infrastructure/Llm/GroqLlmService.cs)
* Update `IsAvailable()` to delegate to `_apiKeyManager.HasAvailableKeys("ProviderName")`.
* Inject the unified `ILlmApiKeyManager`.
* Add logic to sequentially try all keys for the provider if a 429 / rate-limit failure occurs, marking exhausted keys accordingly, and throw an error only when all keys are exhausted.

